  "row_count": 20,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase changes: 903.9 K, melting point of Sb; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 4.750$ kcal/mol. \n1860 K, boiling point of Sb to equilibrium mixture of $Sb(g)$ , $Sb_{2}(g)$ , and $Sb_{4}(g)$ . \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 19.584 + 0.134 \\times 10^{-3} T \\rightarrow 2.216 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{\\circ}-H_{298}^{\\circ}=19.584\\times10^{-3}T+0.067\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+2.216\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-6.588$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-903.9 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 9.244 + 1.065 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 2.597 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 196.500 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 9.244 - 1.065 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 2.597 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 98.250 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 1.673 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n903.9-1860 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = 2.237 - 3.759 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.253 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 153.300 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 2.237 + 3.759 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.253 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 76.650 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 21.266 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data based on Prusaczyk (101) who estimated molecular constants. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase changes: 903.9 K, melting point of Sb; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 4.750$ kcal/mol.",
      "1860 K, boiling point of Sb to equilibrium mixture of $Sb(g)$ , $Sb_{2}(g)$ , and $Sb_{4}(g)$ .",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 19.584 + 0.134 \\times 10^{-3} T \\rightarrow 2.216 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$H^{\\circ}-H_{298}^{\\circ}=19.584\\times10^{-3}T+0.067\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+2.216\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-6.588$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-903.9 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 9.244 + 1.065 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 2.597 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 196.500 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 9.244 - 1.065 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 2.597 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 98.250 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 1.673 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "903.9-1860 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = 2.237 - 3.759 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.253 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 153.300 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 2.237 + 3.759 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.253 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 76.650 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 21.266 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "Source: Data based on Prusaczyk (101) who estimated molecular constants."
    ],
